node_modules
dist
.DS_Store
*.log
.vite

# Local Supabase keys. .env.example is the committed template; the real values
# belong in your shell and in Vercel's environment settings, never in the repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Large 3D room-background scenes — kept local, too big for git (use Git LFS if
# you need them versioned). The app loads them from /public at runtime.
/public/cafe-misti.glb
/public/mafia_the_city_of_lost_heaven-vincenzos_armory.glb
/public/silent_hill_3-gallery.glb
/public/the_grange_dining_room.glb
/public/*.zip

# Theme photo sources, second batch (2026-09-13). 138 originals at ~365MB —
# too big to put in history for what they buy, on the same reasoning as the
# GLB rooms above. The derived assets in public/themes/ ARE committed, so the
# app builds and runs from a clean clone; only re-deriving a theme needs these.
# Re-download from Unsplash into assets-src/themes/<slug>.jpg to rebuild one.
